    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached residence on the grounds of the exclusive Seafield Hotel & Spa Resort\r\n \r\nWarren Estates are delighted to bring this well-appointed family home to the market. Number 3 Hillview Crescent is excellently located on the grounds of Seafield Hotel, one of Ireland’s premier Hotel & Spa resorts.  It enjoys a beautiful coastal setting in the heart of Ballymoney, with private access to a wonderful sandy beach. The setting is mature and peaceful, with the adjoining Hotel and Spa all on site.  \r\n\r\n\r\nNo. 3 Hillview Crescent was built about 25 years ago, this spacious detached home extends to approximately 193 square metres in total and briefly comprises three reception rooms, spacious kitchen/dining room and four double bedrooms (one with ensuite shower room). No. 3 is one of the few houses to have a garage (which also serves as a Utility), and the rear garden is fully enclosed and private. This spacious property offers a good mix of sleeping and living accommodation and is just waiting for someone to put their own stamp to it. \r\n \r\n\r\nBallymoney is a charming seaside Village located beside Tara Hill, 5 minutes’ drive from Gorey Town, with its full range of amenities, and only an hour south of Dublin.  No.3 Hillview Crescent is the ideal permanent or indeed holiday home, offering a spacious detached family home, with all the facilities of the hotel on your doorstep and all the amenities of Ballymoney and Gorey within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t3.2m x 5.35m \t\r\nGuest WC \t\t\t1.9m x 1.6m\r\nW.c., w.h.b., timber flooring.\r\nSitting Room\t\t4.1m x 4.7m\r\nFeature fireplace, T.V. point, French doors to rear.\t\r\nLiving Room/Playroom\t3.1m x 5.3m \r\nBay window, timber flooring.\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room\t3.4m x 7.9m\r\nRange of built-in wall and floor units, timber floor, integrated dishwasher, granite worktops, electric induction hob and cooker, extractor fan, integrated electric oven, doors to rear.\r\nDining Room\t\t2.8m x 4.1m\r\nTimber flooring.\r\nGarage/Utility\t\t2.4m x 6.2m \r\nFitted shelving, plumbed for washing machine, roller door. \r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t4.5m x 4.5m\r\nHotpress, skylight.\r\nBedroom 1\t\t4.2m x 4.7m\r\nRange of fitted wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite\t\t3.0m x 1.2m\r\nShower, w.c., w.h.b., tiled floor, partly tiled walls.  \r\nBedroom 2\t\t3.2m x 5.38m\r\nBay window, built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3\t\t2.9m x 4.2m\r\nFitted wardrobes, timber flooring.\r\nBedroom 4\t          2.9m x 4.6m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes.\r\nBathroom\t\t2.6m x 1.8m\r\nBath with overhead shower, w.c., w.h.b., tiled floor, partly tiled walls, recessed lighting, skylight."
